# Larastan — docs/RULES.md §3: seviye 6 (Faz 4 sonunda 7, R1 sonunda 8). Baseline yalnızca küçülür.
includes:
    - vendor/larastan/larastan/extension.neon

parameters:
    level: 6
    paths:
        - app
        - bootstrap/app.php
        - config
        - database
        - routes
    tmpDir: storage/framework/cache/phpstan
